final_table.text:
Two documents lie on the blotter, squared to the edge. The first is Form 7-C for Sulyna district, reconciled, with the variance posted to Column 4 and a space at the foot for your signature. It is clean. It agrees with the projection. It is exactly what was asked for.

The second is a plain page of arithmetic. It is the sum of the sheets as they stand. It does not agree with anything, and it does not accuse anyone. {asked_why?You asked it once, aloud, and it is still in a room in Sulyna, as clean as the day you put it there.|}

A clerk waits at the door. The Commission meets at four.
